NOTE ON ART ASSETS

This license covers the source code and the original art authored for this
project. The sprites currently under src/main/resources/ are original work
generated with an AI image pipeline and then hand-checked against a fixed
palette; they are not derived from Necesse's own art, and the MIT grant above
covers them.

Should any asset derived from Necesse's sprites be added later, that asset
remains the property of Fair Games Studio and is not covered by the grant
above. Such assets will be identified here.

Necesse is a game by Fair Games Studio. This project is an unofficial mod and
is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
